sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant FE as Frontend (useApi)
  participant BE as Express Route
  participant MW as verifyToken/requireRole
  participant C as Controller
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant R as Redis

  User->>FE: Action (e.g., save votes)
  FE->>BE: HTTP request + ****** token
  BE->>MW: Authenticate + authorize
  MW->>C: req.user context
  C->>DB: Query/update documents
  alt menu endpoints
    C->>R: Cache read/write/invalidate
  end
  C-->>BE: JSON payload
  BE-->>FE: Response
  FE-->>User: Updated UI
